  "description": "Click here and download the Night Sky Procreate Color Palette graphic · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Welcome to a world of inspiration where digital art meets the beauty of nature! Introducing the “Night Sky” Winter Procreate Palette, a collection of 30 carefully selected, deep and expressive shades inspired by a photograph of the starry sky over mountains. This palette is the perfect tool for anyone seeking tranquility, depth, and natural harmony in their work.\n\nWhy you need this palette:\n\nNatural and Deep. The shades, inspired by stardust, mountain landscapes, and the glow of the night, allow you to create realistic, atmospheric illustrations and designs.\n\nPerfect for Fall and Winter Projects. Deep blues, grays, and dark tones create a sense of coziness, warmth, and are ideal for seasonal works, greeting cards, invitations, and decor.\n\nSolves Designers’ Problems. Forget spending hours on color selection. This palette is a ready-made solution that saves you time and lets you focus on creativity. It’s perfect for creating logos, website mockups, illustrations, digital planning, and much more.\n\nEco-Friendly Digital Product. Feel connected to nature by using a palette inspired by natural landscapes. This is the perfect gift for a designer who appreciates unique, sustainable, and useful digital products.\n\nWhat you get:\n\n.swatches file for Procreate (quick installation).\n\nPNG file (for quick access and use in other programs).\n\nJPEG file (for printing or use as a reference).\n\nInstructions for Use:\n\nFor Procreate: Download the .swatches file to your iPad and open it. The palette will automatically be added to your library.\n\nFor other programs (Photoshop, Illustrator, etc.): Use the PNG or JPEG files to pick colors with the eyedropper tool or manually enter the HEX codes.\n\nCreate unique designs filled with the tranquility and depth of the winter sky.",
